        <mxCell id="bus" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;GLOBAL static FIELD BUS&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• Pharmacy.username1 / today / time / ex / expired_bar&#xa;• Login.id / Login.NAME&#xa;• Drug_List writes into Pharmacy.drug.*&#xa;&#xa;Cross-frame coupling → high Henry-Kafura Cp for the hub. This is the hidden dependency that makes the modules NOT cleanly separable." vertex="1">
